:: Bailey Lotus Garden
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

Stepping into the fenced garden, your eyes land on someone. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span>
<br><br>

<<He>> is standing at the edge of the pond. <<He>> doesn't seem to have noticed you yet.
<br><br>

The lotuses are in bloom. White and pink petals catch the sunlight. The water is still.
<br><br>

Bailey gazes into the pond. <<His>> expression is unreadable, but it seems softer than usual.
<br><br>

<<link [[Watch|Bailey Lotus Watch]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> about lotuses|Bailey Lotus Tell]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Talk to <<him>>|Bailey Lotus Ask]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Lotus Watch
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<set $weekly.gardenBaileyLotus to true>>
<<if $bailey_lotus_seen is undefined>><<set $bailey_lotus_seen to 1>><<else>><<set $bailey_lotus_seen += 1>><</if>>

You stand in the doorway. You don't say anything.
<br><br>

Bailey crouches onto <<his>> haunches and reaches down. <<His>> fingers brush the surface of the water, just once. The lotus flowers shift in the ripples. <<He>> watches them for a moment before straightening up and turning around.
<br><br>

<<He>> sees you. <<His>> expression hardens.
<br><br>

<<He>> walks towards you, not quite looking at you. Just when <<he>>'s about to bump shoulders with you, <<he>> speaks, "The pond raises property value. Good work. Don't let them die."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<br><br>

<<He>> bumps past your shoulder and leaves you alone in the garden.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Lotus Ask
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>
<<set $weekly.gardenBaileyLotus to true>>
<<if $bailey_lotus_seen is undefined>><<set $bailey_lotus_seen to 1>><<else>><<set $bailey_lotus_seen += 1>><</if>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I got the seeds for those lotus flowers from the lake," you explain. "I thought they would look nice."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I collected the lotus seeds from the lake," you explain. "The pond seemed like the perfect place to grow them."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You point towards the pond. "I brought the seeds back from the lake. I hoped you wouldn't mind."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I collected the seeds at the lake and planted them here," you explain. "They suit the pond."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Got the seeds for those lotus flowers myself from the lake," you explain. "It was a real pain, but it came out pretty good."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"I dragged the seeds home from the lake and made this filthy pond useful," you say. "They turned out well."
<<else>>
	"I got the seeds for those lotus flowers from the lake," you explain. "It worked out."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $flats_progress gte 2>>
	You recall Bailey's flat with the lotus door knob. "You like them, right?"
	<br><br>
<</if>>

Bailey's shoulders stiffen at your voice. <<He>> doesn't turn to look at you.
<br><br>

"You only got to grow these because I let you use my garden," <<he>> says, turning to you. <<He>> walks towards you and the exit.
<br><br>

<<His>> hand brushes your shoulder on the way out. "Don't let them die."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Lotus Tell
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>
<<set $weekly.gardenBaileyLotus to true>>
<<if $bailey_lotus_seen is undefined>><<set $bailey_lotus_seen to 1>><<else>><<set $bailey_lotus_seen += 1>><</if>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Lotuses... t-they grow in the mud," you explain. "T-The orphanage pond was perfect for them."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Lotuses can grow in mud that would smother other flowers," you explain. "That made the orphanage pond ideal for them."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"They grow in deep mud," you say. "I thought the pond might give them what they need."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Lotuses thrive in mud," you explain. "I knew they would take to the pond."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Most flowers would rot in that mud, but lotuses handle it," you explain. "The pond was finally good for something."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"Lotuses grow where weaker flowers suffocate," you say. "This pond gave them exactly what they needed."
<<else>>
	"Lotuses grow in mud that would suffocate other flowers," you explain. "The orphanage pond was suitable for them."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey stares at the lotus flowers. <<He>> is quiet for a moment.
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	"Hm." <<He>> lets out a hum before reaching down to flick at one of the lotuses that had yet to bloom. "You have that in common, then."
<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 30>>
	"Everything worth something grows in mud," <<he>> says, meeting your eyes briefly before <<he>> turns back to the pond. "You'd know."
<<else>>
	"Throw a seed in a gutter and they'd grow there too." <<He>> scoffs without looking at you, now glaring at the pond. "They're weeds with better marketing."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> turns from the lotus flowers and walks towards you and the exit.
<br><br>

"Don't spend too long out here," <<he>> says, as <<he>> bumps past your shoulder. "It's getting cold."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<br><br>

You're all alone in the garden.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
